{"verse_key": "10:78", "surah": 10, "verse": 78, "text_uthmani": "قَالُوٓا۟ أَجِئْتَنَا لِتَلْفِتَنَا عَمَّا وَجَدْنَا عَلَيْهِ ءَابَآءَنَا وَتَكُونَ لَكُمَا ٱلْكِبْرِيَآءُ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا نَحْنُ لَكُمَا بِمُؤْمِنِينَ", "translation": "They said, \"Have you come to us to turn us away from that upon which we found our fathers and so that you two may have grandeur in the land? And we are not believers in you.\"", "verse_from_ms": 1740870, "verse_to_ms": 1763000, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "قَالُوٓا۟", "start_ms": 1740870, "end_ms": 1743050}, {"i": 1, "text": "أَجِئْتَنَا", "start_ms": 1743050, "end_ms": 1744310}, {"i": 2, "text": "لِتَلْفِتَنَا", "start_ms": 1744310, "end_ms": 1745740}, {"i": 3, "text": "عَمَّا", "start_ms": 1745740, "end_ms": 1746940}, {"i": 4, "text": "وَجَدْنَا", "start_ms": 1746940, "end_ms": 1747970}, {"i": 5, "text": "عَلَيْهِ", "start_ms": 1747970, "end_ms": 1748820}, {"i": 6, "text": "ءَابَآءَنَا", "start_ms": 1748820, "end_ms": 1751950}, {"i": 7, "text": "وَتَكُونَ", "start_ms": 1751950, "end_ms": 1753110}, {"i": 8, "text": "لَكُمَا", "start_ms": 1753110, "end_ms": 1753620}, {"i": 9, "text": "ٱلْكِبْرِيَآءُ", "start_ms": 1753620, "end_ms": 1756550}, {"i": 10, "text": "فِى", "start_ms": 1756550, "end_ms": 1756780}, {"i": 11, "text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "start_ms": 1756780, "end_ms": 1757530}, {"i": 12, "text": "وَمَا", "start_ms": 1757530, "end_ms": 1758190}, {"i": 13, "text": "نَحْنُ", "start_ms": 1758190, "end_ms": 1758760}, {"i": 14, "text": "لَكُمَا", "start_ms": 1758760, "end_ms": 1759560}, {"i": 15, "text": "بِمُؤْمِنِينَ", "start_ms": 1759560, "end_ms": 1762575}]}